    {
      "id": "song-399",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浣溪沙",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王采",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "珠箔随檐一桁垂。绣屏遮枕四边移。春归人懒日迟迟。\n旧事只将云入梦，新欢重借月为期。晚来花动隔墙枝。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c003467eecaa0f13e7538d364536a8f8a4961839c09737529dcabe5c1eaa8db1",
      "estimatedOutput": 698,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-399--c003467eecaa0f13e7538d364536a8f8a4961839c09737529dcabe5c1eaa8db1.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-400",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "满江红",
      "subtitle": "无利无名",
      "author": "张昪",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "无利无名，无荣无辱，无烦无恼。夜灯前、独歌独酌，独吟独笑。况值群山初雪满，又兼明月交光好。便假饶百岁拟如何，从他老。\n知富贵，谁能保。知功业，何时了。算箪瓢金玉，所争多少。一瞬光阴何足道，便思行乐常不早。待春来携酒殢东风，眠芳草。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "71d8509b456c2cdd4bf97a9b4fac0980e768bf9e584e8e47760743edeae217cb",
      "estimatedOutput": 830,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-400--71d8509b456c2cdd4bf97a9b4fac0980e768bf9e584e8e47760743edeae217cb.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-401",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "念奴娇",
      "subtitle": "隆乾间事",
      "author": "刘克庄",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "隆乾间事，两翁有、手泽遗编曾纪。余掌兰台修纂到，景定初开忠邸。坏起复麻，奋涂归笔，嚼碎张巡齿。德音犹在，非卿何足语此。\n老来兹事都休，问门前宾客，今朝来几。达汝空函，投伊大瓮内，谁曾提起。丹汞灰飞，黄粱炊熟，跳出槐宫里。儿童不识，秃翁定是谁子。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "87c3353756fa31285b456b5a7ec9db89d9e8261f2233c466f2d51ba85b78e0e6",
      "estimatedOutput": 844,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-401--87c3353756fa31285b456b5a7ec9db89d9e8261f2233c466f2d51ba85b78e0e6.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-402",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "虞美人",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "谢薖",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "人间离合常相半。璧月宁长满。九秋风露又方阑。何日小窗相对、话悲欢。\n月华临夜宜人醉。老去嗟颜悴。君如玉树照清空。况有凝之道蕴、一尊同。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "adfc70089c9799fa19bb952bb37f48ad499a79bb873f566b1ef52e2238236313",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-402--adfc70089c9799fa19bb952bb37f48ad499a79bb873f566b1ef52e2238236313.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-403",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "踏莎行",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "侯彭老",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "十二封章，三千里路。当年走遍东西府。时人莫讶出都忙，官家送我归乡去。\n三诏出山，一言悟主。古人料得皆虚语。太平朝野总多欢，江湖幸有宽闲处。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ab4168fda9c3c2e9d8bf9d2251448e5a9a5d2aa00885b8cf0efdcfe521b9ae71",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-403--ab4168fda9c3c2e9d8bf9d2251448e5a9a5d2aa00885b8cf0efdcfe521b9ae71.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-404",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "赵长卿",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "远岫螺头湿翠，流霞赪尾疏明。断虹斜界雨新晴。烟村灯火晚，江浦画难成。\n我向其间泛叶，终朝露渚风汀。老来心事最关情。不堪三弄笛，吹作断肠声。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e7d8f7f855005d1d6c5f4915a33fd1a754c9b938f4096ae33ce5bc077545dbb0",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-404--e7d8f7f855005d1d6c5f4915a33fd1a754c9b938f4096ae33ce5bc077545dbb0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-405",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "谒金门",
      "subtitle": "风雨後",
      "author": "黄机",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "风雨後。枝上绿肥红瘦。乐事参差团不就。一春如病酒。楼外暖烟杨柳。忆得年时携手。燕子双双来未久。颇知人意否。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "211d8ce386140939b2ee5e0dacff3b251ca2e90c0dc63d7a55879b9fd8e1d14d",
      "estimatedOutput": 706,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-405--211d8ce386140939b2ee5e0dacff3b251ca2e90c0dc63d7a55879b9fd8e1d14d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-406",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浣溪沙",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "陈允平",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "十二珠帘绣带垂。柳烟迷暗楚江涯。自携玉笛凭丹梯。\n写恨鸾笺凝粉泪，踏青鸳袜溅金泥。落红深处乱莺啼。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c5dbb4fc501143e6b98d93ec04ff5dd9608e72e21b30e06625e9f8a98bbad5f1",
      "estimatedOutput": 698,
